# Verification Code Face — 4 code boxes fed by an invisible number-pad input
# (correct code 1111) with an animated face above: its eyes/head turn (3D
# rotateY + translateX) as the code fills, the mouth/eyes paths morph to a sad
# face on a wrong code (with shake) and a happy one on the right code; resets
# after 1s.
# What this test covers: progressive entry (face turns per digit), backspace
# (face turns back), a wrong code (sad + shake), extra digits while the wrong
# state shows, the correct code (happy), tapping the boxes to refocus, and a
# second correct entry typed digit by digit.
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/verification-code-face"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 45000
# Warm-up touch on the status bar: the first touch of a test can be lost while
# the XCTest runner attaches.
press 330 20
wait 500
wait "label=\"Delete\"" 10000
wait 800
type "12"
wait 800
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 300
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 800
type "1234"
type "9"
wait 2000
type "1111"
wait 2000
press 201 420
wait 500
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 300
press "label=\"Delete\""
wait 500
type "1"
wait 300
type "1"
wait 2000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 15000
press "role=\"button\" label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
